   ],
   "taskIds": [],
   "milestoneId": "m1",
   "status": "Draft",
   "version": 1,
   "body": "# Chapter one script\n\n## Scene one\nThe garden gate is open. Someone has been here before.\n\n## Scene two\nA quiet conversation that sets the tone."
  },
  {
   "id": "d-brief",
   "projectId": "project-garden",
   "name": "Opening brief",
   "kind": "document",
   "ext": "md",
   "bytes": 4800,
   "tags": [
    "brief"
   ],
   "updatedAt": "2026-11-12",
   "description": "Scope and goals for the opening chapter.",
   "requirementIds": [
    "REQ-001"
   ],
   "taskIds": [
    "t1"
   ],
   "milestoneId": "m1",
   "status": "Draft",
   "version": 4,
   "body": "# Opening brief\n\n## Overview\nThe opening chapter introduces the world and its main character. It must feel welcoming without explaining everything.\n\n## Goals\n- Establish tone and setting in the first page\n- Introduce the protagonist through action\n- End on a **clear hook** into chapter two\n\n## Scope\nThis brief covers chapter one only. Later chapters get their own briefs.\n\n## Open questions\n1. Should the narrator be named?\n2. How much backstory belongs in the first scene?\n\n> Review date: 13 November."
  },
  {
   "id": "d-style",
   "projectId": "project-garden",
   "name": "Style guide",
   "kind": "document",
   "ext": "md",
   "bytes": 3100,
   "tags": [
    "style"
   ],
   "updatedAt": "2026-10-15",
   "description": "Voice, visual rules, and naming.",
   "requirementIds": [
    "REQ-004"
   ],
   "taskIds": [
    "t6"
   ],
   "milestoneId": "m2",
   "status": "Final",
   "version": 2,
   "body": "# Style guide\n\n## Voice\nWarm, concrete, and a little playful. Prefer short sentences.\n\n## Visual rules\n- Solid colors, no gradients\n- One accent color per scene\n- Characters are always outlined\n\n## Naming\nUse the spelling in the character bible. When unsure, decide once and note it here."
  },
  {
   "id": "d-auth",
   "projectId": "tsumugi-api",
   "name": "Auth design notes",
   "kind": "document",
   "ext": "md",
   "bytes": 2900,
   "tags": [
    "decision"
   ],
   "updatedAt": "2026-11-11",
   "description": "Session strategy decision record.",
   "requirementIds": [
    "REQ-005"
   ],
   "taskIds": [
    "t8"
   ],
   "milestoneId": "m5",
   "status": "Draft",
   "version": 2,
   "body": "# Auth design notes\n\n## Decision\nUse server-side sessions with secure cookies.\n\n## Why\n- Simple revocation\n- No tokens stored in the browser\n- Works with the planned backend\n\n## Consequences\nThe client must send cookies with every request, and CSRF protection is required.\n\n## Alternatives\n1. Short-lived tokens with refresh\n2. Third-party sign-in only"
  },
